Author uv_camera ray_origin / ray_direction shader links through an ArnoldNodeGraph

The uv_camera ray_origin / ray_direction (and the generic uv_remap) can be
driven by a shader. On export we now author these links through an
ArnoldNodeGraph primitive, referenced from the camera both as a USD connection
(resolved by the translator) and as a string path (resolved by the render
delegate). This test writes such a camera to USD, checks the authored node
graph and connections, and verifies the links are restored on reload.

See #2710

author: sebastien ortega
